Proof once again that the Random Number God has a weird sense of
humor.  It never would have given you that wand back when you were
counting on getting that many wishes.

Personally, I would have gone for the Eye of the A. instead of the
cloak, since it grants MR as well as functioning as an escape item,
at the expense only of MC 3, which you'd get soon enough anyway.
And maybe speed boots instead of the BoH or Grayswandir. (Since the
Eye lets you get to your stash quickly, the BoH is less necessary, and
Excalibur or Mojo are decent enough weapons.)  But that's just
personal preference; I see nothing wrong with your list.

Now turn this into an ascension or we'll never let you hear the end of
it. :-)  You're past the point where you want to be taking *any*
risks now.  Slow and steady, clear each level, and always have at
least one escape item.  (If you can find teleport control, the Orb
of Fate will be good for this once you get it.)  And don't forget
the E-word.  Remember, wands of fire and digging will write it in
one turn.


